"Yes. The sign-in page accepts either the GrapMail address or the phone number you verified, but the number is never the identity of the account, and mail is never addressed to it." = "可以。登入頁面接受 GrapMail 地址或您已驗證的電話號碼，但電話號碼不是帳戶的身分識別，也不會用來收信。";
