"What is an alias for?" = "別名有什麼用？";
"An alias delivers into the same mailbox under a second address, and can be chosen as the sender. Useful when you want to write as “business” without a second account." = "別名是傳送至同一信箱的第二個地址，並可選為寄件者。當您想以「工作」身分寫信又不想另開帳戶時很實用。";
"Mail I was expecting never arrived." = "我在等的郵件一直沒收到。";
"In order: check the sending address was spelled exactly, look in Spam and Trash under “Others”, then check that the sender is not on the suppression list because they unsubscribed earlier. If the mailbox is connected and the message is still missing, the mail server has to be involved. That is a support matter." = "請依序：確認寄件地址拼寫正確，在「其他」下查看垃圾郵件和垃圾桶，再確認寄件者是否因先前取消訂閱而在封鎖名單中。如果信箱已連線但郵件仍未出現，就需要郵件伺服器介入，這屬於客服處理範圍。";
